category=category_4766
runescore=25
reward=Varrock armour 4 and a set of magic lamps worth a total of 150,000XP in four skills of your choice.<br>The armour gains the following extra benefits:<br>- +1% chance for double smelting bane, elder rune.<br>- +1% chance for double ore mining banite, light animica, dark animica.<br>- +1% chance for double progress smithing bane, elder rune.<br>The armour gives five free Bolt Enchant spells per day, up to diamond bolts.<br>Talk to Rat, Reldo or Vannaka to toggle your Varrock Teleport to the north-east of Varrock.<br>Naff will sell up to 80 battlestaves a day.<br>The Varrock estate agent offers half-price housing costs.<br>Access is granted to the log storage chests near each beacon in the beacon network.<br>Reduced chance of being randomly teleported in the Chaos Tunnels.<br>Unlimited teleports to Chaos Tunnels.
