runescore=25
reward=Underworld Grimoire 4 and 1 magic lamp, worth 40,000 XP in a skill of your choice (level 80+).<br>You gain the following extra permanent, passive benefits:<br>- 8 weekly powerful ghostly ink from Lupe.<br>- Lupe will now put weekly rewards in your bank and focus storage.<br>- 10% chance to make 4-dose necromancy, super necromancy and extreme necromancy potions.<br>- First death every day is free.<br>The grimoire gains the following extra benefits:<br>- Daily free teleport to Lupe.<br>The grimoire gains the following extra benefits while worn:<br>- Dropped dinosaur bones, frost dragon bones and reinforced dragon bones are sent to the focus storage (toggleable).<br>- 10% chance per impure essence of receiving extra runes from runecrafting.<br>- +12% XP from dispelling ritual disturbances.<br>- +15% necroplasm from rituals.
name=Underworld Set Tasks - Elite
desc=0,Given by Crunchy, in The Last Call in Um, for completing all Elite Tasks in the Underworld.
